        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Boyd Gaming\n- People: Sam Boyd, Bill Boyd, Thomas Eje, Tom Dane\n- Places: Suncoast Hotel and Casino, Suncoast Casino, Las Vegas\n- Roles: founder, executive chairman, CEO\n\nFacts:\n- On November 15, 2006, Thomas Eje made his Las Vegas debut at the Suncoast Casino under the moniker Tom Dane.\n- In January 2008, Bill Boyd retired as CEO of Boyd Gaming.\n- Bill Boyd, who was born in 1931, currently serves as executive chairman of Boyd Gaming.\n- Boyd Gaming continues to be run by founder Sam Boyd's family under the management of Sam Boyd's son, Bill Boyd.\n- Suncoast Hotel and Casino is owned and operated by Boyd Gaming.",
